\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fungi Finds</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$2,150</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Can be thrown</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.4.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p>Dice are an item found in <a href=\"/wiki/Fungi_Finds\" title=\"Fungi Finds\">Fungi Finds</a>. They can be purchased for a price of $2,150.\n</p><p>The dice come in different forms, such as a d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, and d20. They can also have different colors and materials.\n</p><p>The description reads: \"Wow, it's like they WANTED us to play Dungeons &amp; Dragons!\"\n</p><p>Despite being named Dice, only one is included. The singular term is \"Die,\" while the plural is \"Dice.\"\n</p><p>The d10 is only ambiguous and unfair dice since release, up to this date. Because this dice is shaped as pentagonal bipyramid, and it's incorrectly labeled on sides, not edges. It would be fair dice if the labels are on edges.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Colors_and_Materials\">Colors and Materials</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Materials\">Materials</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Metal</li>\n<li>Marble</li>\n<li>Wood</li>\n<li>Glass</li>\n<li>Plastic</li>\n<li>Granite</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Colors\">Colors</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Bright Red — #d13535</li>\n<li>Persimmon — #fd3535</li>\n<li>Carnation Pink — #f97cfd</li>\n<li>Salmon — #ffa28b</li>\n<li>Brownish Orange — #ce6223</li>\n<li>Yellowish Orange — #dd9211</li>\n<li>Gold — #fdc149</li>\n<li>Neon Green — #affd65</li>\n<li>Bluish green — #5aa6a5</li>\n<li>Pastel blue-green — #8efdf6</li>\n<li>Tr. Blue — #77b8fd</li>\n<li>Alder (purple) — #8f6afd</li>\n<li>Transparent (White) — #ebebeb</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829221720\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 73/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 57/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019391/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.311      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   37.311      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with